Package: MultiOmicQC
Type: Package
Title: Quality control for Multi-omics datasets
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marcel", "Ramos", email = "marcel.ramos@roswellpark.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("MultiAssay", "SIG", email = "biocmultiassay@googlegroups.com",
    role = "ctb"))
Description: This package provides functions for quality control of
    multi-omics datasets represented as MultiAssayExperiment objects.
    It checks the consistency of genomic annotations, such as seqlevels,
    seqlengths, and seqlevelsStyle, across ranged experiments and
    provides helpers for harmonizing them. Sample-level helpers, such as
    clustering on marker features, support checks of sample identity
    against clinical annotations.
Version: 0.0.14
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0),
    MultiAssayExperiment (>= 1.35.0)
